cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the Extreme-WTVD benchmark, please cite the paper below."
title: "A Vision-Based UAV Inspection System for Wind Turbine Defect Detection under Adverse Imaging Conditions"
abstract: >-
  A UAV-based wind turbine inspection framework that combines diffusion-based
  adverse-environment data synthesis, a Feature Calibration Module (FCM), and a
  Multi-Scale Feature Aggregation (MSFA) module. The release includes the
  construction scripts for the Extreme-WTVD benchmark, the leakage-free WTVD
  re-split, all detector baselines, and the machine-readable results behind
  every table in the paper.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Welllee12366/IAS-26-ESC-0712"
keywords:
  - wind turbine inspection
  - defect detection
  - UAV
  - adverse imaging conditions
  - diffusion model
  - domain adaptation
  - multi-scale feature aggregation
